WEBVTT

00:09:27.599 --> 00:09:32.178
And the community team
mobilized incredibly quickly,

00:09:32.202 --> 00:09:36.107
started to talk to all
the other members in the building,

00:09:36.131 --> 00:09:39.106
and I think within 48 hours
they found him a new job.

00:09:40.659 --> 00:09:42.520
And I thought that was amazing,

00:09:42.544 --> 00:09:43.848
that this person,

00:09:43.872 --> 00:09:47.754
you know, we associate
so much of our identity

00:09:47.778 --> 00:09:49.670
and our being to our work,

00:09:49.694 --> 00:09:53.746
and the work we do
and the company that we do it at,

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:58.808
and especially I like to think of it
through the lens of the employee,

00:09:58.832 --> 00:10:02.459
because I think the founders and CEOs
have a bit more agency in those things,